    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i \"stop fighting,\" i'm still here taking up space and money. if i wasn't around, he could finally breathe. he could actually live his life instead of just managing mine. wouldn't it be more selfless of me to just... remove myself from the equation?",
